{
  "file" : "npc/re/instances/Regenschirm.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Oscar",
      "text" : "[Oscar]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Oscar",
      "text" : "The captain sneaked in the control panel room."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Oscar",
      "text" : "Move quietly."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "[Aas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "The door is normally locked with the security system, so I have to stay there and work with the controller."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "As you can see most of the entrances have been blocked already."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "Hi"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "[Aas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "It will take some time to go through them one by one."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "I'll keep helping you through the intercom."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "[Aas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "You'll have to go through the restaurant to reach the hallway."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "Est will be performing the operation alone."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "[Aas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "If there's a disturbance, Est may have caused it. So please check out with her before continuing."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "[Aas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 92,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "You should go now adventurer. I'll keep working on securing the security controller."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "There may be researchers detained inside."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "[Aas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "Please consider their safety first."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "Now go ahead."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "Researcher",
      "text" : "[Researcher]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Researcher",
      "text" : "The biometric scan is still operational, I'll be staying here to keep the door open."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Researcher",
      "text" : "If you're in a hurry, please go..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "[Est]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "Are you the one who removed the poison gas outside?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "You arrived at a good time."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "Because of the gas, the door was forcibly locked down!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 163,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "[Est]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "It takes time for Aas to come hack the controller and release the gas."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 165,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "I was going to do it myself."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 168,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "[Est]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 169,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "The guards here were wearing the same clothes as those Heart Hunters we saw before."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 170,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "I don't think I can save all the researchers alone."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 172,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "[Est]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "It seems we've gathered most of them here already."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 174,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "Let's organize our next strategy."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 177,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "[Est]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 178,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "There are laboratories on the other side and it's likely to be a mess."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 179,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "I wonder if there will be a big fight."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 181,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "[Est]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 182,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "From now on the Rebellion Special Forces will prioritize on rescuing the Detained Researchers."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 183,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "If you get it, move quickly!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 185,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "[Est]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 186,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "Okay, adventurer, find a communication device and get in contact with Aas."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 188,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "[Est]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 189,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "You have to open the entrance of the private labs."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 195,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "[Est]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 196,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "Huh. We'll focus on rescuing the hostages first."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 197,
      "npc" : "Est",
      "text" : "Look for the Security Guard's room that Aas talked about."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 203,
      "npc" : "Access Controller",
      "text" : "Code is inactive."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 204,
      "npc" : "Access Controller",
      "text" : "The communication has been terminated."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Access Controller",
      "text" : "Voice Transmission Connected."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 234,
      "npc" : "Access Controller",
      "text" : "Code is inactive."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 235,
      "npc" : "Access Controller",
      "text" : "The communication has been terminated."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 248,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "[Aas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 249,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "Hey, Did you check all the labs yet?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 250,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "Please check if there are still Detained Researchers."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 254,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "[Aas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 255,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "The spare Master Key still remains."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 256,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "Without it, I wouldn't have been able to control over the security systems. Are you okay?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 258,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "[Aas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 259,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "Now you only need to check the Central Room."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 260,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "Did you say Heart Hunters?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 261,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "The traitors from Schlein have already escaped."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 263,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "[Aas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 264,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "We've got our focus on that room."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 265,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "That's the main idea."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 266,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "Where is Est?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 269,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "[Goni]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 270,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "... ... ..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 273,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "[Aas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 274,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "You have to keep looking for all the Researchers?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 275,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "That's necessary, I understand."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 277,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "[Aas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 278,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "Adventurer, we head to the Central Room."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 279,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "Meet me over there."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 290,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "[Aas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 291,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "Adventurer, we head to the Central Room."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 292,
      "npc" : "Aas",
      "text" : "Meet me over there."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 298,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "[Researcher]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 299,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "My... my search... materials..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 300,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "They took it all!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 301,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "They took everything!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 304,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "[Goni]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 305,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "... ... ..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 309,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "Oh, you're here to protect me?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 310,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "I'll go with you, thank you!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 312,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "[Researcher]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 313,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "Oh, you're there to protect me?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 314,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "I'll go with you, thank you!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 324,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "[Researcher]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 325,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "I thought they kicked out all the crazy guy..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 326,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "I hit the back of my head like this."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 327,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "Tsk."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 329,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "[Researcher]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 330,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "Are you here to save us?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 331,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "Get me out of here!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 332,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "We couldn't flee because they put poisonous gas outside the doors!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 334,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "[Researcher]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 335,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "Yeah, I know a little bit about the Heart Hunters, I will tell you everything!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 338,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "[Est]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 339,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "Ah? Do you have more information to share?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 340,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "Do you want to go outside and talk about it calmly with me?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 343,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "[Est]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 344,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "I'll take this guy out of here and you look at the other rooms."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 355,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "[Researcher]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 356,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "Please help me!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 357,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "I worked a lot and I'm not getting paid!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 359,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "[Researcher]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 360,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "Schlein, where is Schlein?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 361,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "He's a traitor!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 362,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "I've seen it with my own eyes, he just killed the guards..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 364,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "Calm down."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 365,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "[Researcher]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 366,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "Is it safe now?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 367,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "I'm glad when I was hired at Rekenber, but what the hell is going with such a big company..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 369,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "[Researcher]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 370,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "Say what? The Rebellions are coming to save us?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 371,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "Can't I just run away with you instead?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 373,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "[Researcher]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 374,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "Oh... you're part of the recon team?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 375,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "Alright. I'll wait for the rescue team."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 376,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "Many people escaped by breaking the windows and ran away.."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 378,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "[Researcher]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 379,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "Oh you already know."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 380,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "Okay. I'll be quiet now and wait."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 381,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "Your uniform is really cool though."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 385,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "[Researcher]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 386,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "I know. I know."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 387,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "If I wait here, will the Rebellions come and save me?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 388,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "I'll be fine then."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 390,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "[Researcher]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 391,
      "npc" : "Detained Researcher",
      "text" : "But again, your uniform is really cool."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 397,
      "npc" : "Scattered Documents",
      "text" : "This is the list of the Enterprise security teams."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 398,
      "npc" : "Scattered Documents",
      "text" : "Some have circles around them... others are crossed out."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 401,
      "npc" : "Scattered Documents",
      "text" : "[Aas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 402,
      "npc" : "Scattered Documents",
      "text" : "The ones circled are probably those who accepted to be recruited..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 403,
      "npc" : "Scattered Documents",
      "text" : "My team is the one with a X marked next to it."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 405,
      "npc" : "Scattered Documents",
      "text" : "[Aas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 406,
      "npc" : "Scattered Documents",
      "text" : "It's a mercenary contract..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 407,
      "npc" : "Scattered Documents",
      "text" : "There's a rough plan for the day of the raid."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 408,
      "npc" : "Scattered Documents",
      "text" : "I can't believe it came to this..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 410,
      "npc" : "Scattered Documents",
      "text" : "[Aas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 411,
      "npc" : "Scattered Documents",
      "text" : "This is meant to provoke me."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 412,
      "npc" : "Scattered Documents",
      "text" : "It won't work this time. I'll track this to the end."
    },
